  "effectiveDate": "2016-09-20",
  "historyNote": "#6124, eff 11-23-95; ss by #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06 New. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06 (formerly Rev 219.05); ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
